What is a LEV Battery Pack?
A LEV battery pack is a modular energy module that supplies the electric drivetrain of low‑speed vehicles with the required voltage and capacity. Depending on the vehicle class, packs are offered in 24 V, 36 V, 48 V, or higher configurations, delivering power densities that enable ranges of 30–100 km on a single charge. The integration of advanced BMS algorithms provides real‑time monitoring of state‑of‑charge (SOC), state‑of‑health (SOH), temperature, and fault detection, thereby extending service life and enhancing safety.
